{"time": 1766685213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050398238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(٩(•̤̀ᵕ•̤́๑)ᵒᵏᵎᵎᵎᵎ)"}
{"time": 1766685456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111553841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我其实在想，亲姐妹这件事...算不算靠谱。\"慢慢斟酌着开口，\"不是说不信男爵的说法，嗯...我自己也在一个家里面待过。\""}
{"time": 1766685691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879257243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥呢）"}
