{"time": 1766686231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685002628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=003DE103D207C2DAB0BC67D661D88887.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSUBeqoZ_93dvNUie-sWNb0h2_K2BjWq1kg_woo6rfoiavZkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ09vg2yIzoepFIMIz-Bi-q3oCibiCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMDjQ0CQj0MjsY5DH0ZzNq-mV5uigeaNuBKm-yD8bjk1SmndgwYhvDPBAalkFcQha6g,file_size=1463766]"}
{"time": 1766686325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472238500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么说)"}
{"time": 1766686387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478493767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=111553841]“是，我也没见过你”打包好吃的，熄了灯火，离开酒馆"}
{"time": 1766686442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30201909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果是亲姐妹...\"拧着眉毛看着，\"是不是你见过，但是忘了。\""}
{"time": 1766686863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164435772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是见没见过的事情”*摇头“我看过家谱的，这一代我只有一个胞兄”"}
{"time": 1766686883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184671033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 你只要说今天晚上有没有别的事情（）"}
{"time": 1766686901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590303878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有我们就对坐到天明了）"}
{"time": 1766687312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357248954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1164435772]\"...我不知道，那我是被遗弃的孩子?\"低下头"}
{"time": 1766687991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223348057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道，这件事我和你一样好奇。不过现在也没人能问了”走在前面，没回头"}
{"time": 1766688390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153297383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么?哦...\"低着脑袋在后面亦步亦趋，\"我不喜欢我现在的家庭，所以逃出来了...\""}
{"time": 1766689317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409035139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在的家庭？哪？”借着月色在空无一人的街上聊着私密话题“有家庭就算够人羡慕的了……我承认听起来有点像说教。”"}
{"time": 1766689684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952443015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"一个小贵族...之前只有我一个女儿的时候还好...后面养了弟弟...我就好像...\"既然说了那就干脆继续说下去，\"就好像不是他们一家人一样...\"深呼吸，\"所以我逃走了...\""}
{"time": 1766689961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496430021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……还好吧，至少还有个人陪着你”说不出更中听的安慰的话了"}
{"time": 1766689969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763216377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来你想好为什么喜欢杀人了吗（）"}
{"time": 1766690036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321876828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(早就知道了)"}
{"time": 1766690131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404836376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不知不觉就快到了家门口，摸出钥匙打开门“那个，梅丹佐，知道来这么？”"}
{"time": 1766690190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939732903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=496430021]\"真的?...哦...\"皱了皱眉，不置可否，\"梅梅大概会去监狱那边安顿吧...没关系，我半夜会回去。\""}
{"time": 1766690418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123387982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也是，我这里说不定还没有办公室住着舒服”把宵夜放在桌上“我和你说过吗？我的直系亲属都被骑士团清算了这件事”"}
{"time": 1766691027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770470864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇头，\"我不知道...\""}
{"time": 1766691444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899394505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“离现在也差不多十年了”给自己倒上一杯葡萄酒，原本只是打算润润唇，开了口却仰头饮下半杯“一帮人说着什么，解放、审判，就冲进了我的家中。家里连个卫兵都没有……后来是骑士团里一个老爷子看我年少，拦住了其他人，独独留下我一个。”"}
{"time": 1766691635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958030154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"信仰艾奥梅黛的人都是这样。\"感觉在听很遥远的事，伸出手，指了指酒杯，\"我的呢?\""}
{"time": 1766691709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845191869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算了，睡）"}
{"time": 1766691825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527178972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(别急，差一个石头)"}
{"time": 1766710643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759590674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E84E441054B98BFC59253DAC280890FA.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR_MI_lYqqwzFGbcBih2v1FyaXGBxiSqw0g_woons6mgobakQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ7xgQJyyJIqdSv9CBfFxsQHoC1NOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMKYe6ZJO7ZwCQd035v0pK9Gw76VVMYTKKjdnXPcq2znRcTvfGRfGh8pqNBsItsh5Ww,file_size=218514]"}
{"time": 1766711526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754737272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=958030154]另倒一杯，推到卡提希娅面前。带了肉食回来这时候却没什么胃口“我知道还有几个远房，但除了长野镇里这位。”把自己杯中酒液饮尽，迷醉感有些迟钝“其他的都再没敢联系我。后来那个老爷子也死了”"}
{"time": 1766711846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595365474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不怪他们，明哲保身是人之常情”再倒上一杯“但我也不会再去找他们，只当我从来没有这些。”"}
{"time": 1766712209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739469561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接过杯子小口斟饮，\"...所以，我连自己到底是什么人都没有答案了?\"认真地盯着对方，\"本来也许...还算清楚，现在...\""}
{"time": 1766712369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639610029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有出身会更好吗？反正我是不会回那个家的，他们肯定也觉得没有我更好。\"放下杯子，身体有些不爽利，语气悠悠\"反正我喜欢胡作非为，刁蛮任性，又没有同理心。\""}
{"time": 1766712920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206587955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”一时说不出什么话来，这些话自己也说过差不多的，于是又喝一口“看你自己怎么想的。至少我今天……久违地希望自己能高兴一点。”"}
{"time": 1766713138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321599923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"又不是我自己想这样的...\"小声喃喃，收回视线，盯着手里的杯子，\"你之前说过，不想要我这种人当妹妹。\""}
{"time": 1766713390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088159223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我确实说过。”斟酌了一番用词“但如果已经是了，那就另说。”"}
{"time": 1766713595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262380234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那...你有什么感想吗？\"一口气喝完杯子里剩下的酒，空杯子重重落在桌面上，\"妹妹是我这种‘喜怒无常肆意妄为欺软怕硬’的坏胚。\""}
{"time": 1766713893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060410789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要是能早点遇见就好了。”神色有些复杂地看着她，不无落寞地说道“但……也能接受。”"}
{"time": 1766714407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594688714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也能接受?\"眯起眼，\"怎么，你觉得我还有‘救’?\"说完把杯子递上前"}
{"time": 1766714814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180589372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说救不救的，有点太傲慢了。”摇摇头，也把杯子推前“我不做那种事。我只是觉得，如果能早一些遇见，不至于像今天这样”"}
{"time": 1766715113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058772600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不至于像今天这样?\"盯着对方，\"今天怎样?\""}
{"time": 1766715271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260502003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如履薄冰啊……”摇头“叫人没法畅快地高兴起来”"}
{"time": 1766715741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513565845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼...\"偏了偏脑袋，\"怎么看也是做姐姐的问题，自己有妹妹流落也不知道，是也不是?\""}
{"time": 1766715956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676215045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我真的不知道，从来没人和我说过。”顿了许久“但只怕我就算找到了，也不会有什么改变，这之前的我哪有什么话语权？”"}
{"time": 1766716206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354514039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=676215045]\"...\"盯着看了好久，终究是叹了口气，语气软了下来，\"我也不知道，不过现在倒是想通了。\"双手交叠在桌上趴在自己的手上，\"嗯...原来我一直都不是那家人的孩子...这就不奇怪了...这就不奇怪了...\""}
{"time": 1766716284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693538253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（沟槽的新三国还在追我）"}
{"time": 1766716768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699666319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也没听过家里人提过我之后还有个妹妹，年龄上说，恐怕还没记事的时候我们就分开了”看着卡提西亚有些出神“要是我知道我还有个亲妹妹，我就去找你了……不过，恐怕你也不需要了吧”"}
{"time": 1766716948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250806902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么?\"猛地抬起头，\"我还没说清楚吗？那家人...不是我的亲人。\"这些年的委屈涌上鼻尖，吸了下鼻子，眼眶有些濡湿，\"我...也不想这么早...也不想...\""}
{"time": 1766717189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929366183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“毕竟你还有梅丹佐”抿了抿嘴，有些见不得这个画面“她是比我更称职的家人吧”"}
{"time": 1766718194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006680495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1766718464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328563198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1766718477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796467211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥呢)"}
{"time": 1766718486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058937092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是我动啊）"}
{"time": 1766718522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848330631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（梅丹佐都不在场）"}
{"time": 1766718729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345461945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1929366183]\"你不知道...\"突然笑了笑，\"没关系...算了，我要回去了。\""}
{"time": 1766719089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858500577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过...\"摇摇晃晃站起身，\"算是妹妹...算是姐姐?\""}
{"time": 1766719107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755537904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不打算住在这里吗？”有些落寞“……我是不是说错什么了？”"}
{"time": 1766719400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112455286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...诶?我可以住在这了？\"扶着额头，有些晕"}
{"time": 1766719566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521973371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯。”点点头“有空房间，我可以收出来”"}
{"time": 1766719836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172801425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?那就恭敬不如从命啦？\"重新坐下来，\"头有点晕。\""}
{"time": 1766720053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764009003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……虽然恐怕不及旅店……”起身去整理房间“你可以……泡个澡。我其实不太喜欢血腥味”"}
{"time": 1766720203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20262849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我还要去接...梅梅...\"捂着脑袋"}
{"time": 1766720229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059180666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的心灵感应呢）"}
{"time": 1766720389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591807969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那个好像有距离限制来的)"}
{"time": 1766720665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800593934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……算了，看你也坚持不到时间的样子。”摇头“我去找梅丹佐……你换身衣服，今天先住我的房间吧”"}
{"time": 1766720821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501427060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐不是很怕她...?\"摇摇晃晃地起身，\"我去...我去就行...\""}
{"time": 1766721097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886221616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "考虑到她可能已经有的凶名“……好吧”随后久违地说出叮嘱的话“注意安全”"}
{"time": 1766721373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023004037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"眯起眼，磨磨牙齿开口，\"我喝醉了，姐姐要让我自己单独走夜路吗？\""}
{"time": 1766721605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550590267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那谁收拾房间呢）"}
{"time": 1766721638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617110100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我说那种事不急)"}
{"time": 1766721752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267128653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，我们一起”不去收拾房间了，不过那个房间许久不用，似乎也不是一时半会就能收出来的。不过走之前先把水烧上"}
{"time": 1766721839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370184468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "递出手，\"...\""}
{"time": 1766721874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497474618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "夜路黑黑的，路上除了公爵卫兵以外没有一个人，今天还是阴天，月亮和星星都被厚厚的乌云盖住"}
{"time": 1766722107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788728931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "已经不记得上次和人牵上手是什么时候，握上去的时候有些恍神。有些失礼，但是忍不住仔细感受一下说不上光滑的触感……不对，姐妹的话，真的需要在乎“礼”吗？"}
{"time": 1766722419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186633198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“走吧”两只长着茧的手彼此握着，莫名有些心酸"}
{"time": 1766722590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311397769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"心里也有些莫名的酸涩，但是..莫名的安心，虽然说自己现在也有点晕乎乎的"}
{"time": 1766722629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247781063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（去哪来着）"}
{"time": 1766722715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893861709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(监狱)"}
{"time": 1766722745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582810540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "去监狱"}
{"time": 1766723046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335118807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们很快便来到了监狱，梅梅这时候正坐在大厅，看起来很困，但强忍着不让自己睡着，看起来像在用头砸桌子"}
{"time": 1766723087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147690674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这下白收拾了）"}
{"time": 1766723207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668099564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"走到她身边摇晃肩膀，\"怎么不睡?\""}
{"time": 1766723279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7231166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呜呜....嗯！”她看到你忽然惊醒了一下“在...在等小卡...回来”眼神逐渐又迷离了起来，摇摇头，拍拍脸颊去努力保持清醒"}
{"time": 1766723766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280453222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"来...我背着梅梅走...\"虽然自己也有点头晕，\"嘶...\"捂着额头"}
{"time": 1766723804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277853243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡怎么了..”这下她真的清醒了“要..要去哪里..还是我背着小卡吧”"}
{"time": 1766723981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293305095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"去...去姐姐家。\"靠向她的肩膀，\"喝了点酒...有点头晕\""}
{"time": 1766724022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101550384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...我来背着小卡吧”她轻轻把你背起，打了个哈欠“小格带路吧...”"}
{"time": 1766724039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039570299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（小格是什么叫法）"}
{"time": 1766724092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549352087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D1DBF5EA25459D8B9B5F53793210AE34.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRs02IAzPVH8KOaW8ZQouObvsg0vBj5ywIg_woolYzmjrjakQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQyPdapD7SgVbRAVcIRLck6HoC1LOCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMGNPPNQzEi0uxWmuWnVyhGdeKfU19pZUtfJOpJQswEoj0vmeHHxToEuKEDBWNDiV1A,file_size=42489]"}
{"time": 1766724107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949961430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（已经用了这么多次了，我看小卡和小格都没意见啊）"}
{"time": 1766724128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104559467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她没当面叫过我啊）"}
{"time": 1766724141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446777835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(叫过吧)"}
{"time": 1766724144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861465742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那这个，小格对不起）"}
{"time": 1766724149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990976675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是对谁说的）"}
{"time": 1766724183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381584137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是很怪啊）"}
{"time": 1766724203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289214743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一般来说，妹妹会这么叫姐姐吗）"}
{"time": 1766724219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176110122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（梅梅都管小卡叫小卡了）"}
{"time": 1766724257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206936401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我跟她不熟啊）"}
{"time": 1766724259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438583560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能她是龙，所以虽然年纪不大）"}
{"time": 1766724264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188179023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她自来熟啊）"}
{"time": 1766724322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946880049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（而且前面你也没意见）"}
{"time": 1766724355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002745149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你再看看前面是什么场合（）"}
{"time": 1766724384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007252380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（反正她都这样叫了，你有意见告诉她）"}
{"time": 1766724396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917813251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1101550384]\"姐姐带路吧。\"埋头在她肩上，有些睁不开眼"}
{"time": 1766724521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071856290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你的行李都放在这边了？”有些不舍地松开手，略微对称呼有些不适，但也不敢说"}
{"time": 1766724629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833138638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“顺手就拿了...也没多少”然后比较黑，你也没看清，她是怎么把包拿起来的，明明她两只手都被占住了“走吧...”"}
{"time": 1766724655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882914320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1766724753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245203445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"几乎有些睡过去了，\"嗯...嗯...都带着吧...梅梅会...\""}
{"time": 1766730475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724835707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833138638]（那为什么不给我拿呢.jpg）"}
{"time": 1766730891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674690868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;期待&#93;,file=99-997246fc8f386877cc09bef76f114df0.gif,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/99/997246fc8f386877cc09bef76f114df0/raw300.gif,key=b399915ade13d52c,emoji_id=997246fc8f386877cc09bef76f114df0,emoji_package_id=233707]"}
{"time": 1766732293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628161158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“之后还会来，不急这一次。”虽然也有点心不在焉，方才喝得不多但是有些急，但带路还是轻轻松松的"}
{"time": 1766732614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067844560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"强撑着精神，实在有点担心梅梅和姐姐的相处，\"唔...唔唔...\"感腹部有点火热，不安地蹭一蹭"}
{"time": 1766733290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058480232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 路上有事吗.jpg）"}
