{"time": 1766738794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906570454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎...怎么了..小卡..”她有些焦急，又清醒了一分"}
{"time": 1766738861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968661594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"肚子里...有火...\"鼓着嘴"}
{"time": 1766738943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990866091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有...火...怎么会这样..那该怎么办..我往小卡肚子里吐点冰会不会好点..”非常的焦急，急得快原地转起了圈"}
