{"time": 1766743785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727368802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "好在平时用的武器比较重，还抱得起来。把两个“人”抱起来，走进自己房间"}
