{"time": 1766752470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "153071090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "睁开迷蒙的眼睛，几乎看见了大半个自己“嗯……啊？怎么了”"}
{"time": 1766752611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879450015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"做了早餐...嗯...姐姐还要睡吗？\"眨眨眼，后退一步"}
{"time": 1766753549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452036789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不了……只是一起来就能看见人还是第一次。”突然回过身来，裹了裹自己的睡衣“不睡了，今天有好多事”"}
{"time": 1766753611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552644425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...\"乖乖地开口，\"那...吃早餐?\""}
