{"time": 1766771061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687519475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我确实觉得挺好吃的啊...小卡不爱吃，我就全吃完了”"}
{"time": 1766771235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664631094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谁说不爱吃...\"狠狠咬几口，把面包吃完"}
{"time": 1766771545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511099913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吃完甩甩头发，\"我去洗漱。\"找找洗手间在哪"}
{"time": 1766771609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137246023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=511099913][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 房间不是很大，所以你很轻松便找到了，梅梅则坐在餐桌上继续享用着你做的三明治"}
{"time": 1766771842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1484981385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "去洗漱，看看镜子里的自己"}
{"time": 1766772116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479675889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1484981385][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 嘴角微微上扬，看起来很开心的样子"}
{"time": 1766772507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069313731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有这么开心吗？挤了挤自己的脸，拿水洗漱"}
