{"time": 1766772674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26779113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从洗漱间里出来，拍拍脸，重新坐下来"}
{"time": 1766772791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986058379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"早餐也差不多了...吧？\"深呼吸，\"我们是不是该出门了。\""}
{"time": 1766772830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495269107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "差不多刚好马不停蹄地吃完，抿了抿指尖的面包屑“嗯……不错，你怎么还会做这个？”"}
{"time": 1766773016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789890804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"自己一个人在外面，难道能不吃饭吗？\"咬咬唇，\"有段时间没做过了，最近都是偷东西吃。\""}
{"time": 1766773164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479221965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你也没冒险那么久吧（）"}
{"time": 1766773176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934214710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(两年吧)"}
{"time": 1766773472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216870421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”拍拍手上的碎屑，走近一些，试着把手放在卡提希娅脑袋上“以后不用偷了，做饭也可以只是……当个爱好。”"}
{"time": 1766773980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551375399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "乖巧地把脑袋贴上去，\"嗯...但是...嗯...我会好好努力的，下次一定会更好吃...\""}
{"time": 1766774570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681461976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看你们好像都吃的差不多了，梅梅开始收拾起来了餐桌，然后去洗碗，留给你们了二人空间"}
